# SYNTHETIC TEST FIXTURE — not CST-Onto.
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix t: <urn:test:onto#> .
t:CulturalSchema a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Schema"@en , "مخطط"@ar .
t:Motif a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf t:CulturalSchema ; rdfs:label "Motif"@en .
